      "title": "ಗಾತ್ರ (gātra) — size",
      "headword": "ಗಾತ್ರ",
      "romanization": "gātra",
      "gloss": "size",
      "script": "kannada",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:552a63f180008862",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for a sale, then the Kannada for to buy for oneself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಗಾತ್ರ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗಾತ್ರ — gātra — \"size\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಈ ಅಂಗಿ ನನ್ನ ಗಾತ್ರಕ್ಕೆ ಸರಿಯಾಗಿಲ್ಲ. ī aṅgi nanna gātrakke sariyāgilla. This shirt is not my size."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In Sanskrit a limb or the body; Kannada uses it for the size of things."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗಾತ್ರ (gātra) is borrowed from Sanskrit gātra, \"a limb, the body\" (CDIAL 4124); in Kannada it came to mean bulk and size."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
