          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಖಾತರಿ (khātari) came into Kannada through Hindustani; it is usually traced to Arabic khāṭir, \"the mind, regard\", but how it came to mean an assurance is not settled."
            }
